# 🐳️ Build-context exclusions for 🌎️hub/Dockerfile (see its header — the image is UNBUILT).
# Deliberately conservative: only host-local state and compiler output that the builder stage
# recreates. Committed `🤖️generated` sources are NOT excluded — several crates and the plugin
# catalog are generated-then-committed, and dropping them would break the build inside the image.
.git
.jj
node_modules
target
temp
test-results
storybook-static
**/🗑️generated
**/dist/build
**/dist/build-dev
**/dist/build-release
**/dist/publish
**/.DS_Store
